{"id":"n47976-1-6","stage":0,"title":"최고 · 最好","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n47976-1-6-1","ko":"살이 많이 쪄서 걱정이에요.","zh":"我胖了很多，好担心啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"살이","meaning":"身上的肉（与体重有关）","explanation":"살 指人身上的肉；살이 찌다 是长胖，살이 빠지다 是变瘦，살을 빼다 是减重。这里不是梳子齿、年龄或皮肤义。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66883","senseId":"1","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살이","audio":"/audio/10d950f9fb857268bb30.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"쪄서","meaning":"长胖了","explanation":"찌다：长胖；-어서 交代担心的原因。","readings":[{"term":"찌다","audio":"/audio/22c11459d6526bb8d7a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62375","senseId":"1","lemma":"찌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쪄서","audio":"/audio/acee0d8de9a7f87b66a4.mp3"}},{"text":"걱정이에요.","meaning":"担心，忧虑，担忧","explanation":"걱정：担心，忧虑，担忧；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"걱정","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17232","senseId":"1","lemma":"걱정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걱정이에요","audio":"/audio/026911a52e1dca50bfcd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d804a5a98c800c56","term":"살","zh":"身上的肉（与体重有关）","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3","entryId":"66883","definition":"身上的肉（与体重有关）","pronunciation":["살"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"22c11459d6526bb8","term":"찌다","zh":"发胖，长膘","audio":"/audio/22c11459d6526bb8d7a9.mp3","entryId":"62375","definition":"身上长肉变胖。","pronunciation":["찌다"]},{"id":"7582493f75565a84","term":"걱정","zh":"担心，忧虑，担忧","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3","entryId":"17232","definition":"害怕发生不好的事情而感到不安。","pronunciation":["걱쩡"]}],"audio":"/audio/0a80420dc460bba87dea.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n47976-1-6-2","ko":"살을 빼는 데에는 운동이 최고죠.","zh":"想要减肥的话，运动才是最好的方法啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"살을","meaning":"身上的肉（与体重有关）","explanation":"살 指人身上的肉；살이 찌다 是长胖，살이 빠지다 是变瘦，살을 빼다 是减重。这里不是梳子齿、年龄或皮肤义。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66883","senseId":"1","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살을","audio":"/audio/52da6c8617f35997f4c4.mp3"}},{"text":"빼는","meaning":"减肥，减重","explanation":"빼다：减肥，减重；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"빼다","audio":"/audio/2a9a5583b5aa17960d82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85714","senseId":"9","lemma":"빼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빼는","audio":"/audio/aeaf7aaad05e51160e06.mp3"}},{"text":"데에는","meaning":"在……这件事上（这里指减重）","explanation":"-는 데 在这里把前面的动作作为讨论的事项；살을 빼는 데에는 表示“在减重这件事上、要减重的话”，不是实际地点。","readings":[{"term":"데","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47455","senseId":"1","lemma":"데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"데에는","audio":"/audio/9623f95d91ca1f626977.mp3"}},{"text":"운동이","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운동이","audio":"/audio/f9764d1081d03a9455b1.mp3"}},{"text":"최고죠.","meaning":"最好","explanation":"최고：最好；-죠 带有提醒、确认的语气。","readings":[{"term":"최고","audio":"/audio/97b8be84b3d009c4b9b1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47976","senseId":"1","lemma":"최고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"최고죠","audio":"/audio/acb6a2604c3c3427c9cc.mp3